  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHANGE: Improving Access to Education in Ethiopia for Most Marginalized Girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">45000</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Ethiopia&apos;s very traditional north, the &#x2018;Leaving No Girl Behind&#x2019; programme focuses on providing more girls with longer access to education. Girls tend to leave school early to contribute to family income or get married. Extra courses aim to improve how girls are valued and to increase their chances of graduating. However, such educational measures are only effective if everyone participates: teachers and government representatives, as well as Welthungerhilfe&#x2019;s local employees.</narrative>
  </description>
